      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "URANA STORM (7) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (30.60) at this track behind Jilliby Pixie in a Grade 5. Chased the leaders and with a clean run can be prominent. Top chance in this line up. RIVERS MEET (1) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing sixth (30.20) in a Grade 4/5 at Sandown. Form at the trip sound including two wins. One of the main contenders. HANDSOME RATIO (2) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by a nose at Sandown in a handy 34.79. Fair draw can see a good run and goes well at this distance. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Has hit winning form and can go on with it. DETECTION (5) is another with top-three prospects.",
